                <pb facs="0367" n="1045" sameAs="frus:frus1863p2/pg1045"/>

                <head>No. 1.</head>
                <p>When Matsudaira Gamba No Kami was charged with the protection of the temporary
                    residence of the British envoy at To-sen-ji, his subordinate officer, Ito Gunbe,
                    slipped in and murdered British subjects; and besides, other officers, also
                    subordinates of Gamba No Kami, who had been placed there for protection, were
                    unable to arrest the said Gunbe; this was caused by imperfect instructions to
                    his subordinates. For this neglect he was reprimanded, and having requested to
                    be put under arrest, he is now under arrest in compliance with his request.</p>
            </div>
